  'lab.gas.assume': 'Steady-state experiments: separate from the mechanics lab, they do not generate live blood gases, SpO₂, ETCO₂ or pH. Assumptions: a single homogeneous alveolus, no leak, regular ventilation, 37 °C, pH 7.40, adult Hb, no dyshemoglobin, constant PvO₂. A change in mechanical settings does not change these results by itself.',
